# The laptop on its own. Left empty on purpose: fill it in with
# whatever you want undocked.
#
# Directives:
#   name    <label shown in the picker>
#   order   <sort position, lower comes first, default 50>
#   needs   <role>...   monitors that must be connected
#   include <scene>     pull in another scene's slots
#   optional <scene>    the same, skipped when that scene is absent
#   bar     <role> on|off
#   orient  <role> <slot> left|right    which side master sits
#   slot    <role> <slot> web <url>     chromeless browser window
#   slot    <role> <slot> run <command> anything else
#
# Roles come from monitor-run roles. The first slot line for a
# workspace becomes its master window. A run command is handed to
# a shell, so quote anything holding a # or a space.
name    Undocked
order   40
needs   laptop

# slot  laptop 1 run kitty
# slot  laptop 2 run firefox --new-window 'https://example.com/'
